
Usage: /KICK <username>
  Kicks  <username>  out  of the current channel.  The kicked user may
  not  enter  until  /UNKICK is used to reverse the effect.  Users may
  not  be kicked out of immortal channels.  Only channel operators are
  allowed to use this command.

  Example:
     /KICK badboy

  See Also:
     /UNKICK

